# ============================================================================
# dirgin — PUBLIC repo. Default-deny whitelist.
#
# This repository contains ONLY our own original port source, tooling and
# research notes. It MUST NOT contain Square Enix game data or anything derived
# mechanically from the game binary. Policy: ignore everything, re-include only
# our source/doc file types, then re-exclude generated/derived/build trees and
# third-party content that the whitelist would otherwise sweep back in.
#
# Build this port against your own legally-owned copy of the game disc.
# ============================================================================

# 1) Ignore everything by default.
*
# 2) ...but descend into directories so whitelisted files are reachable.
!*/

# 3) Re-include our own source + documentation file types only.
!*.c
!*.h
!*.cpp
!*.hpp
!*.cc
!*.py
!*.md
!*.java
!*.cmake
!*.vert
!*.frag
!*.glsl
!*.comp
!*.sh
!Makefile
!CMakeLists.txt
!README*
!LICENSE*
!.gitignore
# browser client source (native/web; its data/ is re-excluded in section 5)
!native/web/*.html
!native/web/*.js
!native/web/*.mjs
!native/web/actions/*.js
!native/assets/collision/*.mjs

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4) Re-exclude DERIVATIVES OF THE COPYRIGHTED GAME BINARY (never public):
#    the Ghidra decompilation and the static-recompilation OUTPUT.
#    (dir/** so these win over the file whitelist — last match wins.)
#    NOTE: our hand-written recompiler/runtime/oracle SOURCE under port/recomp
#    and port/oracle IS kept; only the generated output dirs are dropped.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
analysis/**
ghidra-proj/**
elf/**
**/gen/**
**/generated/**
**/generated_all/**
eetu_*.c
ee_funcs.c
ee_funcs.h
function_table.c

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5) Re-exclude RAW GAME DATA (ISO rips, extracted assets, captures).
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
extract/**
downloads-ref/**
native/assets/models/out/**
native/assets/models/doc_model/**
native/movie/out/**
native/web/data/**

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 6) Re-exclude BUILD TREES + generated build files the whitelist re-admits
#    (CMake emits Makefile / *.cmake / compiler_depend.ts into these).
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/build/**
**/build_verify/**
**/cmake-build-*/**
**/CMakeFiles/**
**/Testing/**
**/obj/**
**/out/**
**/__pycache__/**
cmake_install.cmake
CTestTestfile.cmake

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 7) Re-exclude THIRD-PARTY content (not ours to redistribute):
#    a clone of the community DoC-Research wiki.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
notes/doc-research-wiki/**

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 8) Loose build artifacts / scratch (defensive).
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.o
*.d
*.a
*.so
*.pyc
*.log
*.err
.claude/
